1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,333
StudyHub: a calm place for your courses, tasks, timetable and notes.

2
00:00:07,167 --> 00:00:15,167
Start by creating an account.
Your data is private. Nobody else can see it.

3
00:00:18,867 --> 00:00:24,267
This is your overview page.
Your lectures, tasks and upcoming deadlines for today.

4
00:00:24,367 --> 00:00:32,367
Step 1: add your courses.
Open Courses, click add, and type the course name.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:44,033
Add the rest the same way.
College courses or any course outside college.

6
00:00:44,133 --> 00:00:52,133
Your weekly timetable.
Lectures, sections, labs, and your own study sessions.

7
00:00:56,900 --> 00:01:04,667
Tasks and deadlines.
Each task has a course, a day to do it, and a deadline.

8
00:01:04,767 --> 00:01:09,733
Pick the course and set the deadline.
You get reminders 1 day, 12 hours and 1 hour before.

9
00:01:09,833 --> 00:01:17,833
The fastest way: the assistant.
Write like you text a friend, and it adds everything for you.

10
00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:34,300
Tasks and the lab slot were added.
Each one is linked to the right course.

11
00:01:34,433 --> 00:01:42,200
Back on the overview.
Now it shows today's lectures, tasks and deadlines.

12
00:01:42,333 --> 00:01:50,333
Focus timer.
Open a task and press start. Your study time is tracked.

13
00:01:53,100 --> 00:02:01,100
Bring your Obsidian notes.
In Settings, upload your notes folder or a ZIP of it.

14
00:02:01,567 --> 00:02:06,167
The library.
Folders open and close like in Obsidian.

15
00:02:06,267 --> 00:02:14,267
Notes render cleanly.
Math, code, callouts, tables and diagrams all work.

16
00:02:16,167 --> 00:02:24,167
Weekly review.
Hours studied, time per course, finished tasks and your streak.

17
00:02:24,333 --> 00:02:28,933
Turn on notifications.
From Settings, on your phone and your laptop.

18
00:02:29,033 --> 00:02:32,767
Reminders in your own voice.
Record a clip for each stage and it plays with the reminder.

19
00:02:32,867 --> 00:02:35,967
Use Claude with it.
Create a connector here, then ask Claude about your tasks and notes.

20
00:02:36,100 --> 00:02:44,100
Arabic or English.
Switch with the button at the top.

21
00:02:44,467 --> 00:02:48,067
On your phone.
Open the link in Chrome and choose Add to Home screen.

22
00:02:53,100 --> 00:02:59,433
Happy studying! Website: study-joox-friends.loophole.site. Code: github.com/yousefJooX/studyhub.
